      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If it's technically feasible, if said avatars vram usage exceed the set limit it would downsize the textures to 2k, 1k, 512px to reach the set amount.\nHeck, a local texture override so nothing goes over 2k would be the bomb.",
